{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"agent_message","text":"The core now has six connected mazes, twelve moving snacks per board, three predator behaviors, power reversals, tunnels, rotating gates, and disappearing walls. A legal-input bot has cleared the full campaign with normal lives in about 5¾ simulated minutes. Human first-run timing is still unmeasured; that test establishes that the campaign can be completed without shortcuts or cheats.\n"}}
