{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_51","type":"agent_message","text":"The Hub checks passed, including impaired-network stage transitions and tied time-up results. Browser testing then caught a major layout bug: the canvas kept its default 300×150 size, cropping the board and breaking pointer coordinates. I’m fixing that, along with menu hover focus and a controller reassignment pause, before rerunning the affected checks.\n"}}
